    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/toy-storefront/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Toy Storefront theme is a dynamic, user-friendly solution designed for toy stores, kids’ toy shops, online toy stores, educational toy stores, toy boutiques, playtime toy storefronts, toy retailers, toy e-commerce stores, party toy stores, hobby stores, gift shops, board game shops, puzzle shops, and related businesses looking to create a vibrant and engaging online presence. It provides a customizable platform for selling toy set bundles, science kits, role-play toys, learning kits, sports toys, building blocks, action figures, dolls, puzzles, board games, STEM toys, Montessori toys, electronic toys, creative play sets, and educational toys. With features tailored for e-commerce, the theme supports online toy store promotions, FAQs, toy store events, product showcases, interactive galleries, and integrates seamlessly with SEO tools for better visibility. Its playful, colorful, and child-friendly visual design ensures a fun and engaging browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Compatible with essential plugins like WooCommerce for effortless product management and sales, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, and Yoast SEO for improved search rankings, the theme provides full functionality for toy retailers. Additional features like loyalty programs, community engagement options, promotional banners, customizable layouts, and packaging personalization enhance customer retention and brand identity. Whether selling educational toy kits, sports toys, or hosting toy-related events and promotions, the Toy Storefront theme offers a professional, fully responsive, and highly interactive platform that helps your toy business thrive and delight both children and parents alike."
    },
